---
description: Role to model map for the long-horizon harness
alwaysApply: true
---

<!--
Strong model for the lead and for judging (checkers, live-check): these roles decide.
Fast model for writing and finding: these roles produce volume.
Keep checkers on a different model family than the writers they check, so they do not share blind spots.
Replace every <placeholder> with a model name available in your Cursor plan.
-->

| Role | Model | Why |
| --- | --- | --- |
| lead | <strong-model-A> | one long chat; decides, briefs, merges |
| writer | <fast-model-B> | many short runs; does the work |
| finder / researcher | <fast-model-B> | reads and reports file pointers |
| checker | <strong-model-C, different family from the writer> | measures; passes or rejects |
| live-check | <strong-model-C> | opens the live result as a user would |

When you spawn a worker, set its model from this table. Do not let a checker use the writer's model family.
